[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3291613133","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110528#issuecomment-3291613133","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110528","id":3291613133,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EMgfN","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T11:07:37Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T12:34:24Z","body":"~`apply_force`~ `apply_impulse` isn't really relevant here as it's invalid to apply it in `_physics_process`, you also shouldn't set `linear_velocity` every frame, so not sure if this is a bug since","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3291613133/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3291783135","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110528#issuecomment-3291783135","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110528","id":3291783135,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ENJ_f","user":{"login":"PiCode9560","id":122909224,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1NyKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122909224?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560","html_url":"https://github.com/PiCode9560","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T11:53:44Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T11:59:31Z","body":"> apply_force isn't really relevant here as it's invalid to apply it in _physics_process\n\nSince when you should not do this? It was never mentioned anywhere.\n\nEdit: from the `apply_force` doc force are meant to be applied every frame: `A force is time dependent and meant to be applied every physics update.`\n\nYou might be mistaken it as `apply_impulse`\n\n> you also shouldn't set linear_velocity every frame, so not sure if this is a bug since\n\nI was trying to make a custom damping system, here's a simplified version: `linear_velocity *= 0.9`. If I cannot set it every frame, how am I supposed to do it?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3291783135/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3291960521","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110528#issuecomment-3291960521","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110528","id":3291960521,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EN1TJ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T12:34:10Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T12:34:10Z","body":"For `apply_force` indeed mixed the two up, it's `apply_impulse` should not be called every frame\n\nFor `linear_velocity` it's [documented](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_rigidbody3d.html#class-rigidbody3d-property-linear-velocity):\n> The body's linear velocity in units per second. Can be used sporadically, but don't set this every frame, because physics may run in another thread and runs at a different granularity. Use `_integrate_forces()` as your process loop for precise control of the body state.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3291960521/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3292089504","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110528#issuecomment-3292089504","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110528","id":3292089504,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EOUyg","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T13:09:48Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T13:11:29Z","body":"There's nothing wrong with calling `apply_force` or `apply_impulse` from `_physics_process` per se, but you can't/shouldn't do it while also changing the velocities, as they'll end up fighting eachother, as the `linear_velocity` and `angular_velocity` properties aren't immediately updated when applying impulses/forces, so you end up resetting them to \"stale\" values. Those properties are better suited for one-off changes during initialization and things of that nature.\n\n> I was trying to make a custom damping system, here's a simplified version: `linear_velocity *= 0.9`. If I cannot set it every frame, how am I supposed to do it?\n\nAs mentioned, the way you're meant to do this is through `_integrate_forces`, which gives you easy access to `PhysicsDirectBodyState3D`, which doesn't have the above mentioned problem with its velocities. In your case you probably also want to enable the `custom_integrator` property, which will cause the default force integration (including gravity and damping) to be skipped.\n\nIt could look something like this:\n\n```gdscript\nextends RigidBody3D\n\nfunc _init() -> void:\n\tcustom_integrator = true\n\nfunc _integrate_forces(state: PhysicsDirectBodyState3D) -> void:\n\t# Apply your damping\n\tstate.linear_velocity *= max(1 - state.total_linear_damp * state.step, 0)\n\tstate.angular_velocity *= max(1 - state.total_angular_damp * state.step, 0)\n\n\t# Add gravity if you want\n\tstate.linear_velocity += state.total_gravity * state.step\n\t\n\t# Integrate whatever other impulses you want\n\tstate.linear_velocity += Vector3.UP * state.step\n\t\n\t# ... or use the helper methods available on `PhysicsDirectBodyState3D`\n\tstate.apply_central_impulse(Vector3.UP * state.step)\n```\n\nIf you were just adding impulses and not wanting to replace the existing damping, you can also do this instead:\n\n\n```gdscript\nextends RigidBody3D\n\nfunc _init() -> void:\n\tcustom_integrator = true\n\nfunc _integrate_forces(state: PhysicsDirectBodyState3D) -> void:\n\t# Apply the default damping and gravity\n\tstate.integrate_forces()\n\n\t# Integrate whatever other impulses you want\n\tstate.linear_velocity += Vector3.UP * state.step\n\n\t# ... or use the helper methods available on `PhysicsDirectBodyState3D`\n\tstate.apply_central_impulse(Vector3.UP * state.step)\n```\n\nKeep in mind that when using `custom_integrator` you're meant to do all the force integration yourself, so `apply_force`, `apply_central_force` and `apply_torque` won't do anything. You'll need to stick to impulses only.\n\nAlso, since you wrote `apply_impulse(Vector3.UP, Vector3.ZERO)`, keep in mind that a `position` of `Vector3.ZERO` is not the same as `apply_central_impulse(Vector3.UP)` since the center-of-mass may be at a different relative position than `Vector3.ZERO`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3292089504/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3292144795","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110528#issuecomment-3292144795","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110528","id":3292144795,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EOiSb","user":{"login":"PiCode9560","id":122909224,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1NyKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122909224?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560","html_url":"https://github.com/PiCode9560","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T13:24:00Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T13:24:00Z","body":"@mihe Thanks for the tips, very helpful.\n\nI guess this is not a bug I'm just doing it wrong, so I'm closing this issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3292144795/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3292931242","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110528#issuecomment-3292931242","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110528","id":3292931242,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ERiSq","user":{"login":"Boernd85","id":114452991,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtJp_w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114452991?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boernd85","html_url":"https://github.com/Boernd85","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boernd85/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boernd85/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boernd85/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boernd85/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boernd85/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boernd85/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boernd85/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boernd85/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boernd85/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T16:09:39Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T18:44:13Z","body":"https://github.com/Boernd85/Boernd85.git","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3292931242/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0